# The repair probe waits for every member of each asked configuration
# instead of a Phase-1 quorum of qualifying answers: one member down for
# good blocks a lost slot that a quorum could decide. The audit's
# `blocked_in_asked` asks for a quorum, so the red has the cause "none",
# not `Beyond::Loss`. The mutant bites only when a lost slot's repair
# probe hears a faulty report and a member of an asked configuration is
# down for good while a Phase-1 quorum still qualifies. The state needs a
# wipe of a member that holds no copy of the lost slot in a configuration
# of five, which the wipe budget seldom allows (#773 owns it).
expect: caught
cause: fleet: no tenant is left mid-operation after chaos
file: crates/lib/paros-core/src/proposer.rs
--- find
        .all(|config| config.has_phase1_quorum(&qualifying))
--- replace
        .all(|config| config.members().iter().all(|m| qualifying.contains(m)))
--- end
